    <md:title>2.12.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>8385c1db-1473-4fbd-968b-b6f6a5cd0c0d</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">A builder is using a mix of different tiles to remodel a kitchen. The marble tiles cost, \(x\), $15 per square and the ceramic tiles, \(y\), cost $7 per square. The total amount allowed for tiles is at most $900. Which inequality represents this situation?</para>
 </section>
</content>
</document>
